<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Electric - 6mth group results.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Electric - 6mth group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.70 trln	 vs	    1.60 trln</p>
<p> Pre-tax	     27.00		vs	   53.50</p>
<p> Net		    6.30		vs	   25.20</p>
<p> EPS		    3.07 yen	  vs	   10.97 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Mitsubishi Electric Corp is a comprehensive electric machinery maker. (Figures are reported based on U.S. accounting rules.)</p>
</text>
